---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Getting to Sikkim | Feels Like Om</title>
    <meta name="description" content="How to travel from Bagdogra Airport into West Sikkim, with recommended arrival and departure flight timings and transfer guidance." />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/type-system.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/">Feels Like Om</a>
      <button class="mobile-nav-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <details class="nav-dropdown">
          <summary class="active">ABOUT</summary>
          <div class="submenu">
            <a href="/about/our-stories">Our stories</a>
            <a href="/about/getting-to-sikkim" aria-current="page">Getting to Sikkim</a>
            <a href="/about/visa-and-permits">Visa and permits</a>
            <a href="/about/life-on-sikkim-time">Life on Sikkim time</a>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="nav-dropdown">
          <summary>JOURNEYS</summary>
          <div class="submenu">
            <a href="/journeys/the-flagship">The Flagship</a>
            <a href="/journeys/how-to-embrace-suffering">To Be Free</a>
</div>
        </details>
        <a href="/reflections">REFLECTIONS</a>
        <a href="/contact">CONTACT</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="wide hero-copy">
          <h1>Getting to Sikkim</h1>
          <p class="hero-intro">We can help coordinate your airport transfer so you don’t have to arrange the journey on your own. Before booking your flights, please speak with us, so that your transfer and the drive can be planned comfortably.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="flight-section">
        <div class="wide">
          <div class="flight-block">
            <h2>Departure flights</h2>
            <div class="option">
              <h3>Option 1: Arrive a day earlier and stay at a nearby hotel</h3>
              <p>This gives you a greater selection of flight options, with shorter layovers and less red-eye flights. Stay a night in Siliguri, and your driver can pick you up directly from your hotel. We are happy to provide tried-and-tested recommendations for hotels in Siliguri.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="option">
              <h3>Option 2: Book a flight that arrives in Bagdogra Airport <u>before 10:30AM</u> on the first day of your trip</h3>
              <p>This allows sufficient time for the drive, inclusive of lunch and tea breaks, so that you can reach the homestay in time for dinner.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flight-block">
            <h2>Return flights</h2>
            <div class="option">
              <h3>Option 1: A more relaxed departure</h3>
              <p>Stay an extra night in Siliguri on the last day of your trip. You will have more options to choose from, in terms of duration, layovers, and price.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="option">
              <h3>Option 2: Book a flight that departs from Bagdogra Airport <u>after 5:00PM</u> on the last day of your trip</h3>
              <p>Breakfast will be served between 7–8AM, and check-out will be latest by 9AM for you to make it for your flight.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flight-block recommendations">
            <h2>Our recommendations</h2>
            <div class="option">
              <h3>Cost of round trip flights</h3>
              <p>Flights typically range from SGD 400–800.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="option">
              <h3>Minimum layover duration</h3>
              <p>We recommend <u>minimum of four hours</u> for you to have sufficient time to collect and drop your bags, go through immigration and security.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="route-section" aria-labelledby="route-title">
        <div class="route-wrap">
          <h2 id="route-title" class="sr-only">Journey from Bagdogra Airport into Sikkim</h2>
          <div class="route-step"><p>Arrive at Bagdogra Airport</p></div>
          <span class="route-arrow" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
          <div class="route-step"><p>Meet your driver at the airport</p></div>
          <span class="route-arrow" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
          <div class="route-step"><p>Drive through West Bengal,<br />have lunch along the way</p></div>
          <span class="route-arrow" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
          <div class="route-step"><p>Apply for <a href="/about/visa-and-permits">Sikkim permit at the check post</a> (you’re leaving West Bengal and entering Sikkim)</p></div>
          <span class="route-arrow" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
          <div class="route-step"><p>Continue your journey to the village</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
      <script src="/mobile-nav.js" is:inline></script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing:border-box; }
  body { margin:0; background:#f4efe5; color:#18301f; overflow-x:hidden; font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:var(--type-body); }
  a { color:inherit; text-underline-offset:.3rem; }
  .wide { width:min(1180px,92%); margin:0 auto; }
  .site-header { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:2rem; padding:1.5rem 4%; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.15); }
  .brand { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap; }
  .main-nav { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1.5rem; letter-spacing:.08em; }
  .main-nav > a,.main-nav summary { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer; }
  .main-nav .active { border-bottom:1px solid currentColor; }
  .nav-dropdown { position:relative; }
  .nav-dropdown summary { list-style:none; }
  .nav-dropdown summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
  .submenu { position:absolute; top:calc(100% + .65rem); right:0; width:max-content; min-width:13rem; padding:.7rem; background:#fffaf1; box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(8,20,12,.13); z-index:10; opacity:0; visibility:hidden; transform:translateY(-4px); transition:opacity 160ms ease,visibility 160ms ease,transform 160ms ease; }
  .submenu::before { content:""; position:absolute; top:-.75rem; left:0; right:0; height:.75rem; }
  .submenu a { display:block; padding:.65rem .75rem; color:#18301f; text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:0; }
  .submenu a:hover { background:rgba(24,48,31,.06); }
  @media (hover:hover) { .nav-dropdown:hover .submenu { opacity:1; visibility:visible; transform:translateY(0); } .nav-dropdown:not(:hover) .submenu { opacity:0; visibility:hidden; transform:translateY(-4px); } }

  .page-hero { padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,8rem) 0 clamp(3.5rem,7vw,5.5rem); }
  .page-hero h1 { margin:0; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:var(--type-display)!important; line-height:.98; font-weight:400; }
  .hero-copy { max-width:1180px; }
  .hero-intro { max-width:760px; margin:1.5rem 0 0; line-height:1.7; font-size:var(--type-body)!important; }

  .flight-section { padding:clamp(5rem,9vw,8rem) 4%; background:#18301f; color:#f4efe5; }
  .flight-block { margin-bottom:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,7rem); }
  .flight-block:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }
  .flight-block h2 { margin:0 0 clamp(2.25rem,4vw,3.5rem); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:var(--type-section)!important; line-height:1.04; font-weight:400; }
  .option { max-width:920px; margin-bottom:2rem; }
  .option h3 { margin:0 0 .35rem; font-family:var(--font-body)!important; font-size:var(--type-body)!important; font-weight:700!important; line-height:1.45; }
  .option p { margin:0; font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:var(--type-body)!important; line-height:1.65; }

  .route-section { padding:clamp(5rem,9vw,8rem) 4% clamp(6rem,10vw,9rem); }
  .route-wrap { width:min(720px,100%); margin:0 auto; display:grid; justify-items:center; text-align:center; gap:1.7rem; }
  .route-step { max-width:520px; }
  .route-step p { margin:0; font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:var(--type-lead)!important; line-height:1.45; }
  .route-arrow { font-size:2rem; opacity:.75; transform:scaleX(1.2); }
  .sr-only { position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; padding:0; margin:-1px; overflow:hidden; clip:rect(0,0,0,0); white-space:nowrap; border:0; }

  @media (max-width:760px) {
    .site-header { align-items:flex-start; padding:1.15rem 1.25rem; }
    .main-nav { gap:.75rem; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:flex-end; }
    .submenu { right:auto; left:0; }
    .nav-dropdown[open] .submenu { opacity:1; visibility:visible; transform:translateY(0); }
    .wide { width:calc(100% - 2.5rem); }
    .page-hero { padding-top:4rem; }
    .hero-intro { margin-top:1.25rem; }
    .flight-section,.route-section { padding-left:1.25rem; padding-right:1.25rem; }
    .flight-block { margin-bottom:4rem; }
    .route-wrap { gap:1.35rem; }
    .route-arrow { font-size:1.6rem; }
  }
</style>
